From e8ce5ed448bd8e8c145382f7059ef7eba116662b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Mon, 05 Oct 2026 11:12:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Build split keyboard from phone layouts

Tablet layouts carry extra keys such as delete on the top row and a wide
enter key on the home row, which leave the split halves uneven and force
small keys. Like Gboard, build the split keyboard from the phone
layouts instead, so each half gets the usual five letters per row.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ia46acc729be1f6ccd512e65ef95b7baf2c455ee0
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

